tic crash  wouldn't exist where enough for the cg  team behind the scenes in visual effects  sometimes you got to do it sometimes  there's no other way  number 15 vfx blasts don't stand a  chance against this superhero homelander  want to shake it up a bit no matter how  many shots the vfx team created to be  fired they didn't do any harm or slow  down the superhero at all to be honest i  think he's the weakest character on the  show i think you know super strength  these fiery details are key since they  helped to show us in the very beginning  of the series just how powerful anthony  star's character could be plus it looks  super rad that is a  wrap the cgi effects used in the boys  amp up this series to make it one of the  best there is these days we'd never have  guessed cg was used in so many instances  in the series but what we can say is  that all of them were done pretty  flawlessly  which scene had your favorite cgi work
 

